          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "After meeting in Paris, Rosa and her French boyfriend Pierre travel to Colombia to get married and enjoy their honeymoon. However, everything changes when their in-laws reveal a shocking secret and try to stop the wedding, turning the trip into a chaotic and bitter experience.",
